        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "          278 Tingkauh' Bumaengh 'Than' Thouckey o",
            "                           8.7.10.8. Ref. 9. 10. 10.6",
            "          Doh hei E",
            "",
            "          1. Tingkauh' Bumaengh 'Than' thouckey o;",
            "             Guang bamlou o 'niw pangc khou.",
            "             Nchyang thaulou dat ro ziprimei ta,",
            "             Kaganv taek makna bamlou o.",
            "",
            "                  He aniw ning e Bumaengh 'Thanmei",
            "                  Nang rui hamh 'thei chaeng tat maanv ngam ni the,",
            "                  Zaylou o, gaanphiu gaanhmei ramc Zion khou;",
            "                  Nang ramc thanh gaymei khou.",
            "",
            "",
            "          2. Dinclou o, Kamei thuakloumei;",
            "             Ringh' chaeng thay makmei nunc khou.",
            "             Nang zei rui thuakloumei hei saa ngammak;",
            "             Ch'rynmei Nang ramrianraa guay ta.",
            "",
            "          3. Tingkauh 'Thanmei Nang bam ethei,",
            "             Kandihmei guay dwan gay ni.",
            "             Kandih siimei paapc ric adow sihnic,",
            "             Nang zanc thuanhpui lu suan bam ni.",
            "",
            "          4. Guigaypouc Jisu guang dat ro.",
            "             Ryanraana Nang khaengvloumei,",
            "             Dinc tat ni Nang sauh pyrun runmei lam;",
            "             Ch'rynmei Nang ramrianraa guay tei."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
